Hey, what's that?
嘿，那是什么？

07:55.433 --> 07:57.533
The Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy movie
人鱼男
和藤壶男孩电影

07:57.533 --> 07:58.900
is opening tonight!
今晚开业！

07:58.900 --> 08:01.167
Wow!
I totally forgot.
哇！
我完全忘记了。

08:01.167 --> 08:03.433
Hey, guys, I've got an idea.
嘿，伙计们，我有一个主意。

08:03.433 --> 08:06.100
Let's all go to
the Mermaid Man movie.
我们都去
人鱼男电影。

08:06.100 --> 08:07.567
- [laughs]
- [笑]

08:07.567 --> 08:12.167
You're incorrigible, but
the cinema is a delightful idea.
你已经无可救药了，但是
电影院是一个令人愉快的主意。

08:12.167 --> 08:13.933
There's a foreign film
at the art house
有一部外国电影
在艺术之家

08:13.933 --> 08:15.500
I've been meaning to see.
我一直想去看看

08:15.500 --> 08:18.100
It's called, "The Table."
它的名字叫“桌子”。

08:18.100 --> 08:21.300
[high-pitched whistling]
[高亢的口哨声]

08:21.300 --> 08:22.400
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

08:22.400 --> 08:24.933
[cat meowing]
[猫喵喵叫]

08:24.933 --> 08:26.433
- I don't get it.
- 我不明白。

08:26.433 --> 08:29.067
We've been staring at this table
for three hours.
我们一直盯着这张桌子
三个小时。

08:29.067 --> 08:30.600
That table could use a cleaning.
那张桌子需要清洁一下。

08:30.600 --> 08:31.967
- Shh!
- 嘘！

08:31.967 --> 08:35.233
Some people are trying
to enjoy lé cinema.
有些人正在尝试
享受 lé 电影院。

08:35.233 --> 08:36.533
- Oh, hey, Squidward.
- 哦，嘿，章鱼哥。

08:36.533 --> 08:38.500
Hey, do you understand
what this movie's about?
嘿嘿，你明白吗
这部电影是关于什么的？

08:38.500 --> 08:39.867
- Nobody does.
It's art.
- 没有人这样做。
这是艺术。

08:39.867 --> 08:41.067
Now sit down!
现在坐下！

08:41.067 --> 08:43.167
- Hey, Squidward?
- What?
- 嘿，章鱼哥？
- 什么？

08:43.167 --> 08:45.267
- Are you remembering to
flip the patties clockwise?
- 你还记得吗
顺时针翻转馅饼？

08:45.267 --> 08:46.833
It's very important
because the heat--
这非常重要
因为热量——

08:46.833 --> 08:49.567
- Please, sit down!
- 请坐！

08:49.567 --> 08:51.067
- I'm sorry, sir.
- 对不起，先生。

08:51.067 --> 08:52.600
You're being too loud.
你太大声了。

08:52.600 --> 08:55.367
I'm going to have to
ask you to leave.
我将不得不
请你离开。

08:55.367 --> 08:56.867
- Uh, wait, Squidward!
- 呃，等等，章鱼哥！

08:56.867 --> 08:58.233
I'll walk you out!
我送你出去！

08:58.233 --> 09:01.133
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

09:01.133 --> 09:03.467
- Squidward!
- 章鱼哥！

09:03.467 --> 09:05.067
- Hey, SpongeBob!
- 嘿，海绵宝宝！

09:05.067 --> 09:08.067
Y'all going to see
the Mermaid Man movie with us?
你们都会看到
和我们一起看美人鱼人电影吗？

09:08.067 --> 09:10.767
- SpongeRobert, yoo-hoo.
- 海绵罗伯特，哟吼。

09:10.767 --> 09:12.067
Are you coming?
你来吗？

09:12.067 --> 09:13.833
We're going to drink
some more coffee
我们要去喝酒
再喝点咖啡

09:13.833 --> 09:15.933
and watch the nightly news.
并观看晚间新闻。

09:15.933 --> 09:19.333
- Wow, that sounds pretty
grown up, SpongeRobert.
- 哇，听起来不错
长大了，海绵罗伯特。

09:19.333 --> 09:22.533
- My pants say
yes, yes, yes,
- 我的裤子说
是的，是的，是的，

09:22.533 --> 09:24.667
but my heart says no.
但我的心说不。

09:24.667 --> 09:26.467
I wanna see
the Mermaid Man movie.
我想看看
人鱼男电影。

09:26.467 --> 09:29.367
- [laughs]
Now you really sound like
- [笑]
现在你听起来真的像

09:29.367 --> 09:32.900
one of those nitwits that
frequents the Krusty Krab.
那些白痴之一
经常光顾蟹堡王。

09:32.900 --> 09:35.100
- Not only am I
one of those nitwits,
- 不光是我
那些白痴之一，

09:35.100 --> 09:36.900
I actually work there!
我实际上在那里工作！

09:36.900 --> 09:38.233
[angelic chorus]
[天使合唱]

09:38.233 --> 09:41.633
- Ugh!
A peasant in long pants.
- 呃！
一个穿长裤的农民。

09:41.633 --> 09:43.433
- Social-climbing sponge.
- 社交攀登海绵。

09:43.433 --> 09:44.733
- Poser!
- 装腔作势！

09:44.733 --> 09:46.867
- Let's leave
this bottom-feeder.
- 我们离开吧
这个底部进料器。

09:46.867 --> 09:48.200
- Attaboy!
- 阿塔博伊！

09:48.200 --> 09:49.900
I got you a ticket
just in case.
我给你买了票
以防万一。

09:49.900 --> 09:51.900
- [gasps]
Really?
- [喘气]
真的吗？

09:51.900 --> 09:55.667
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

09:55.667 --> 09:58.400
- I'm sorry,
you can't come in.
- 对不起，
你不能进来。

09:58.400 --> 10:00.433
This movie is too silly
这电影太傻了

10:00.433 --> 10:04.200
for a cultivated gentleman
of your pant length.
对于一位有教养的绅士
你的裤子长度。

10:04.200 --> 10:06.667
House rules.
房子规则。

10:06.667 --> 10:07.867
- What?
- 什么？

10:07.867 --> 10:10.467
"Rated for those
in knee-highs only"?
“评价为那些
只穿及膝”？

10:10.467 --> 10:13.200
Oh, I hate these pants!
哦，我讨厌这条裤子！

10:13.200 --> 10:16.133
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:23.500 --> 10:24.500
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:24.500 --> 10:26.467
Get off!
下车！

10:26.467 --> 10:28.500
[horn blaring, tires screeching]
[喇叭声、轮胎摩擦声]

10:28.500 --> 10:29.733
Aah!
Oh!
啊啊！
哦！

10:29.733 --> 10:32.700
[crashes]
[崩溃]

10:32.700 --> 10:34.500
Ah, now I know I'm an adult,
啊，现在我知道我已经是个成年人了，

10:34.500 --> 10:38.900
because I've been ripped off
by these defective pants.
因为我被骗了
就因为这些有缺陷的裤子。

10:38.900 --> 10:41.900
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:41.900 --> 10:43.733
- What's going on?
- 这是怎么回事？

10:43.733 --> 10:45.367
How pathetic.
多么可悲啊。

10:45.367 --> 10:49.467
A man in long pants crying.
一个穿着长裤的男人在哭泣。

10:49.467 --> 10:51.300
- [sighing, sniffling]
- [叹气，吸鼻子]

10:51.300 --> 10:53.933
Mr. Krabs, why aren't you
watching the movie?
蟹老板，你为什么不呢？
看电影？

10:53.933 --> 10:55.300
- How can I watch the movie
- 我怎样才能看电影

10:55.300 --> 10:58.133
with all this blubbering
going on out here?
伴随着所有这些哭泣
这里发生什么事了？

10:58.133 --> 11:01.567
- Oh, Mr. Krabs,
I'm not ready for long pants.
-哦，蟹老板先生，
我还没准备好穿长裤。

11:01.567 --> 11:03.467
I want my short pants back,
我想要回我的短裤

11:03.467 --> 11:06.467
but I can't because
these are stuck on me.
但我不能因为
这些都粘在我身上。

11:06.467 --> 11:09.067
- Oh, for Pete's sake.
- 哦，看在皮特的份上。

11:11.767 --> 11:13.200
Sorry about the legs, boy.
对不起，孩子的腿。

11:13.200 --> 11:14.733
- [laughs]
It's okay.
- [笑]
没关系。

11:14.733 --> 11:17.400
I'm a sponge, remember?
我是一块海绵，记得吗？

11:17.400 --> 11:19.167
- [laughs]
Well, good!
- [笑]
嗯，很好！

11:19.167 --> 11:22.067
Then I want you back on
the grill tomorrow morning.
然后我要你回来
明天早上烧烤。

11:22.067 --> 11:24.667
And if it makes you
feel any more manly,
如果它让你
感觉更有男人味了

11:24.667 --> 11:27.600
you can do your grilling
outdoors.
你可以烧烤
户外。

11:27.600 --> 11:28.867
- Sounds great!
- 听起来很棒！

11:28.867 --> 11:31.333
And I'll be driving to work.
我会开车去上班。

11:31.333 --> 11:32.733
- Wait a minute!
- 等一下！

11:32.733 --> 11:34.600
Oh, no, you don't.
哦，不，你不知道。

11:34.600 --> 11:36.433
Not with those short pants.
不适合那些短裤。

11:36.433 --> 11:38.467
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

11:43.467 --> 11:45.500
- I don't know what
that was all about,
- 我不知道什么
这就是全部，

11:45.500 --> 11:47.067
but I'm glad it's over.
但我很高兴一切都结束了。

但我很高兴一切都结束了。